\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Jesus Christ, grow Thou in me,
\par And all things else recede:
\par My heart be daily nearer Thee
\par From sin be daily freed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Each day let Thy supporting might
\par My weakness still embrace;
\par My darkness vanish in Thy light,
\par Thy life my death efface.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In Thy bright beams which on me fall,
\par Fade every evil thought;
\par That I am nothing, Thou art all,
\par I would be daily taught.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. More of Thy glory let me see,
\par Thou Holy, Wise, and True!
\par I would Thy living image be,
\par In joy and sorrow too.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Fill me with gladness from above,
\par Hold me by strength divine!
\par Lord, let the glow of Thy great love
\par Through my whole being shine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Make this poor self grow less and less,
\par Be Thou my life and aim;
\par O make me daily, through Thy grace,
\par More meet to bear Thy name!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

